i/images/4/45/Tamago_p%27s2.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20120906074704","caption":"Пирсинг Love Melo Deco","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/4/45/Tamago_p%27s2.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20120906074704"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Love%26melody_box.jpg","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/e/e3/Love%26melody_box.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20121123233653","caption":"Из альбома «Tamagotchi P's» · № 11","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/e/e3/Love%26melody_box.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20121123233653"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:TamaPsCharacterArtwork.jpg","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/b/bb/TamaPsCharacterArtwork.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20210822225222","caption":"Изображение списка персонажей","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/b/bb/TamaPsCharacterArtwork.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20210822225222"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:TamaPsCharacterRoster.jpg","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/2/2f/TamaPsCharacterRoster.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20210822225222","caption":"Спрайты списка персонажей","sprite":true,"large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/2/2f/TamaPsCharacterRoster.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20210822225222"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:TamaPsFeature1.PNG","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/1/10/TamaPsFeature1.PNG/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20210822225226","caption":"Экран ухода и объяснение личности и частей головоломки","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/1/10/TamaPsFeature1.PNG/revision/latest?cb=20210822225226"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:TamaPsFeature2.PNG","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/f/f2/TamaPsFeature2.P